      "data": {
        "Name": "Well",
        "ID": "Well",
        "Description": "A Well is a permitted or actual drilled hole in the ground designed to exchange (or facilitate the exchange of) fluids between a subsurface reservoir and the surface (or another reservoir), or to enable the detection and measurement of rock properties.",
